  "unevaluatedProperties": false,
  "$comment": "Generation numbers are component-local and never a join key. Sequence is atomic reservation order, not a cross-component clock. A schema-valid consecutive prefix cannot prove no later setter. Require original journal envelopes, a bound identity manifest, complete earlier attempts, closed critical pairs, and strict timestamp non-overlap for positive order findings. Never infer the caller from time proximity. An absent cap marker does not prove that the cap was not reached."
